  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Từ đồ thị, ta có trục đối xứng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Bề lõm parabol hướng lên nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Đồ thị cắt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></semantics></math> tại điểm có tung độ dương nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>b</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Parabol cắt trục hoành tại hai điểm phân biệt nên phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> nghiệm phân biệt.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math> khi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">]</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>4</mn></semantics></math> giá trị nguyên của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\" form=\"postfix\">}</mo></mrow></semantics></math> thỏa <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ol>",
